# Keep the build context small and free of anything machine-specific.
.git/
.github/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dev-dist/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/coverage/
backend/static/
data/
recordings/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
docs/
**/tests/
**/*.md
